{"seq":1,"slug":"bff-patterns-aggregation","title":"BFF 模式与聚合层设计","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","categoryLabel":"后端工程","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation","rating":{"composite":3.5,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# BFF 模式与聚合层设计 简介\n\nBFF（Backend for Frontend）是介于前端与后端微服务之间的专属编排层，为每类前端体验聚合下游数据、裁剪字段、塑造视图模型，把客户端的多次往返与编排负担搬到服务端。本 hub 面向日常构建 BFF 与聚合层的后端工程师，覆盖 BFF 的定位与取舍、扇出聚合与部分失败降级、客户端驱动的契约与版本协商，以及缓存性能、鉴权安全、可观测性与测试等生产实践。贯穿全程的纪律是：BFF 应当薄——只编排与塑形，不沉淀业务决策。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bff-foundations","title":"Bff Foundations","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/bff-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-bff","title":"什么是 BFF（Backend for Frontend）","url":"/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/bff-foundations/what-is-bff","wordCount":1418,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"bff-vs-api-gateway","title":"BFF 与 API 网关的区别","url":"/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/bff-foundations/bff-vs-api-gateway","wordCount":1266,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"when-to-use-bff","title":"何时该用 BFF，何时不该","url":"/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/bff-foundations/when-to-use-bff","wordCount":1373,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章建立 BFF 的基础认知：先界定什么是 BFF 以及它「一端一后端、薄而无状态」的本质，再厘清它与 API 网关在职责、数量与变更频率上的分野与协作，最后给出何时该引入、何时不该引入 BFF 的决策信号与介于直连和全套 BFF 之间的折中形态。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"aggregation-design","title":"Aggregation Design","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/aggregation-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fan-out-aggregation","title":"扇出与聚合","url":"/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/aggregation-design/fan-out-aggregation","wordCount":1212,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"response-shaping","title":"响应整形与视图模型","url":"/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/aggregation-design/response-shaping","wordCount":1344,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"partial-failure-handling","title":"部分失败与降级","url":"/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/aggregation-design/partial-failure-handling","wordCount":1256,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章聚焦 BFF 的核心工作——聚合：用并发扇出把客户端的多次串行往返压缩成一次服务端编排，把下游领域模型整形为贴合页面的视图模型，并在某个下游失败时按关键/可选分级优雅降级，让单点故障收敛在局部而非放大成整页崩溃。\n"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contract-and-versioning","title":"Contract And Versioning","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/contract-and-versioning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"client-driven-contracts","title":"客户端驱动的契约","url":"/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/contract-and-versioning/client-driven-contracts","wordCount":1376,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"versioning-strategies","title":"版本协商策略","url":"/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/contract-and-versioning/versioning-strategies","wordCount":1347,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"schema-and-typing","title":"模式定义与类型安全","url":"/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/contract-and-versioning/schema-and-typing","wordCount":1405,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章讨论 BFF 的接口契约：它由客户端需求而非领域模型驱动，常以屏幕驱动的页面专属端点呈现并归前端团队拥有；面对设备上长期存活的多版本客户端，需用向后兼容的加法式演化与必要时的版本协商；并用显式模式定义与端到端类型安全把契约变成被工具守护的可执行工件。\n"},{"seq":4,"slug":"bff-in-production","title":"Bff In Production","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/bff-in-production","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"caching-and-performance","title":"缓存与性能","url":"/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/bff-in-production/caching-and-performance","wordCount":1355,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"auth-and-security","title":"鉴权与安全","url":"/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/bff-in-production/auth-and-security","wordCount":1435,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"observability-and-testing","title":"可观测性与测试","url":"/h/backend-engineering/bff-patterns-aggregation/bff-in-production/observability-and-testing","wordCount":1491,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"本章把 BFF 推向生产：在关键路径上用分层缓存与并发、批量、超时预算等手段压低延迟；作为令牌边界处理鉴权、守住公网与内网之间的信任边界、用白名单裁剪防数据泄露；并以分布式追踪为核心、配合指标日志与契约测试，让「一进多出」的扇出结构保持可诊断、可信赖。\n"}]}